<h1>12_光学、医疗、计时与电子仪器 (Optical, Medical & Electronic Devices)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>1082</b> 词（分为 <b>4</b> 个折叠子表，已配图 <b>1082</b> 张）• 法语模式已包含 <b>定冠词 le/la + 阴阳词性 (n.m./n.f.) + 雌雄双形态 + 特殊复数</b></p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#93c5fd;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_相机镜头、望远镜与光学仪器 (47)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_钟表、天平、温度计与测量仪表 (115)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_手术器械、听诊器、绷带与医疗用品 (12)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_电脑外设、音响、传感器与电子设备 (908)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_相机镜头、望远镜与光学仪器 (Cameras, Lenses & Optical Gear)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 47 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='22%'>单词 (英 / 法性数完整形态)</th><th width='14%'>音标 (英 / 法 IPA)</th><th width='22%'>中文释义</th><th width='24%'>英文定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='6%'>词频</th><th width='12%'>实物配图</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>lens</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la glace<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 lens</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/lenz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/glas/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('lens', 'la glace')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 透镜, 镜头, 镜片, 晶状体</td><td class='def-en'>a transparent optical device used to converge or diverge transmitted light and to form images</td><td>4.17</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_1' data-word="lens" src='images/lens.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('lens', 'optical', 'img_1')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>radio telescope<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la radiotélescope<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 radio telescope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'reidiәu 'teliskәup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁadjɔteleskɔp/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('radio telescope', 'la radiotélescope')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>[电] 无线电测远仪</td><td class='def-en'>astronomical telescope that picks up electromagnetic radiations in the radio-frequency range from extraterrestrial sources</td><td>3.77</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_2' data-word="radio telescope" src='images/radio_telescope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('radio telescope', 'optical', 'img_2')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>telescope</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'ampleur<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 telescope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'teliskәup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɑ̃plœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('telescope', 'l\'ampleur')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 望远镜</td><td class='def-en'>a magnifier of images of distant objects</td><td>3.75</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_3' data-word="telescope" src='images/telescope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('telescope', 'optical', 'img_3')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>photographic camera<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'appareil photo<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 photographic camera</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˌfəʊtəˈgræfɪk ˈkæmərə/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/apaʁɛj fɔto/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('photographic camera', 'l\'appareil photo')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>照相机</td><td class='def-en'>equipment for taking photographs (usually consisting of a lightproof box with a lens at one end and light-sensitive film at the other)</td><td>3.73</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_4' data-word="photographic camera" src='images/photographic_camera.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('photographic camera', 'optical', 'img_4')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>solar telescope<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la télescope solaire<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 solar telescope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈsəulə ˈteliskəup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/teleskɔp sɔlɛʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('solar telescope', 'la télescope solaire')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 太阳望远镜</td><td class='def-en'>a telescope designed to make observations of the sun</td><td>3.68</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_5' data-word="solar telescope" src='images/solar_telescope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('solar telescope', 'optical', 'img_5')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>telescope sight<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la lunette<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 telescope sight</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈteliskəup sait/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/lynɛt/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('telescope sight', 'la lunette')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>[体]光学瞄准具; 望远镜式瞄准器</td><td class='def-en'>gunsight consisting of a telescope on a firearm for use as a sight</td><td>3.68</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_6' data-word="telescope sight" src='images/telescope_sight.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('telescope sight', 'optical', 'img_6')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>magic lantern<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la lanterne magique<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 magic lantern</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'mædʒik 'læntәn/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/lɑ̃tɛʁn maʒik/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('magic lantern', 'la lanterne magique')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>幻灯</td><td class='def-en'>an early form of slide projector</td><td>3.58</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_7' data-word="magic lantern" src='images/magic_lantern.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('magic lantern', 'optical', 'img_7')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>optical telescope<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'ampleur<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 optical telescope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈɔptikəl ˈteliskəup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɑ̃plœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('optical telescope', 'l\'ampleur')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>光学望远镜</td><td class='def-en'>an astronomical telescope designed to collect and record light from cosmic sources</td><td>3.58</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_8' data-word="optical telescope" src='images/optical_telescope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('optical telescope', 'optical', 'img_8')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>reflecting telescope<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la télescope réflecteur<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 reflecting telescope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/rɪˈflektɪŋ ˈteliskəup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/teleskɔp ʁeflɛktœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('reflecting telescope', 'la télescope réflecteur')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 反射式望远镜</td><td class='def-en'>optical telescope consisting of a large concave mirror that produces an image that is magnified by the eyepiece</td><td>3.53</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_9' data-word="reflecting telescope" src='images/reflecting_telescope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('reflecting telescope', 'optical', 'img_9')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>microscope</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la microscope<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 microscope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'maikrәuskәup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/mikʁɔskɔp/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('microscope', 'la microscope')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 显微镜</td><td class='def-en'>magnifier of the image of small objects</td><td>3.5</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_10' data-word="microscope" src='images/microscope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('microscope', 'optical', 'img_10')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>light microscope<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la microscope optique<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 light microscope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/lait ˈmaikrəskəup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/mikʁɔskɔp ɔptik/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('light microscope', 'la microscope optique')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>光学显微镜，光镜</td><td class='def-en'>microscope consisting of an optical instrument that magnifies the image of an object</td><td>3.49</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_11' data-word="light microscope" src='images/light_microscope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('light microscope', 'optical', 'img_11')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
