<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>compound microscope<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la microscope<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 compound microscope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/kәm'paund 'maikrәuskәup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/mikʁɔskɔp/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('compound microscope', 'la microscope')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>[医] 复式显微镜</td><td class='def-en'>light microscope that has two converging lens systems: the objective and the eyepiece</td><td>3.42</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_16' data-word="compound microscope" src='images/compound_microscope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('compound microscope', 'optical', 'img_16')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>reflex camera<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'appareil photographique reflex<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 reflex camera</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈri:ˌfleks ˈkæmərə/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/apaʁɛj fɔtɔgʁafik ʁefl/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('reflex camera', 'l\'appareil photographique reflex')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 反射式照相机</td><td class='def-en'>camera that allows the photographer to view and focus the exact scene being photographed</td><td>3.42</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_17' data-word="reflex camera" src='images/reflex_camera.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('reflex camera', 'optical', 'img_17')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
