<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>peep sight<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la mire métallique<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 peep sight</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/pi:p sait/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/miʁ metalik/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('peep sight', 'la mire métallique')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>取景</td><td class='def-en'>rear gunsight having an adjustable eyepiece with a small aperture through which the front sight and the target are aligned</td><td>3.36</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_20' data-word="peep sight" src='images/peep_sight.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('peep sight', 'optical', 'img_20')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
