<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>astronomical telescope<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la télescope<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 astronomical telescope</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˌæstrəˈnɔmɪkəl ˈteliskəup/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/teleskɔp/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('astronomical telescope', 'la télescope')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 天文望远镜</td><td class='def-en'>any telescope designed to collect and record electromagnetic radiation from cosmic sources</td><td>3.3</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_23' data-word="astronomical telescope" src='images/astronomical_telescope.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('astronomical telescope', 'optical', 'img_23')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>overhead projector<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le rétroprojecteur<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 overhead projector</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈəuvəhed prəˈdʒektə/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁetʁɔpʁɔʒɛktœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('overhead projector', 'le rétroprojecteur')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 高射投影仪</td><td class='def-en'>a projector operated by a speaker; projects the image over the speaker's head</td><td>3.29</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_24' data-word="overhead projector" src='images/overhead_projector.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('overhead projector', 'optical', 'img_24')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
